13. Limitations

The current version is a command-line application and does not include a graphical user interface or web interface.

Employee data is stored in a text file rather than a database. The payroll calculations are also based on the fixed salary rules implemented in the program.

The current system focuses on basic employee and payroll management rather than advanced features such as attendance tracking, leave management, tax slabs, or automated monthly payroll processing.

